+`8d 05` → `c7 c0`). `is_tls_reloc` (x86-64): `16..=23 | 34..=36 | 44 | 45 | 47 | 48 | 50 | 51`
+(29..=31 is GOTPC64/GOTPLT64/PLTOFF64, **not** TLS).
